OL,3,ABurnham addressing COP31 climate summit
OL,4,Aafter being pressed on Rosebank oil
OL,5,Afield
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK Prime Minister Andy Burnham is
OL,8,Fspeaking at the COP31 climate
OL,9,Fconference - watch live above
OL,11,FHe is one of a number of world leaders
OL,12,Fin Antalya, Turkey, for the fourth day
OL,13,Fof the annual UN summit
OL,15,FHe is expected to say the "climate
OL,16,Fcrisis is upon all of us now" and
OL,17,Fpledge a "new era of British
OL,18,Fleadership" while reiterating the UK's
OL,19,Fambition to reach net zero by 2050
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
