OL,3,ABurnham addressing COP31 climate summit
OL,4,Aafter being pressed on Rosebank oil
OL,5,Afield
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government is announcing the
OL,8,Fappointment of a new climate security
OL,9,Fenvoy, Dame Madeleine Alessandri, and
OL,10,Fsays she will help identify, plan and
OL,11,Fprepare for climate risks before they
OL,12,Freach crisis point
OL,14,FIt comes after Burnham was pressed by
OL,15,FTory leader Kemi Badenoch in Parliament
OL,16,Fon Wednesday about whether the Rosebank
OL,17,Foil field would be allowed to proceed
OL,19,FIn October the government
OL,20,Fcontroversially approved drilling in
OL,21,Fthe Jackdaw gas field in the North Sea
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
