OL,4,Areportedly weighs ousting CEO Jensen
OL,5,AHuang after second affair allegation
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier this week, the CEO admitted he
OL,8,Fhad been "unfaithful" to his wife and
OL,9,Fapologised to her and their children
OL,11,FNvidia is the world's second most
OL,12,Fvaluable company after Apple and is at
OL,13,Fthe heart of the AI industry - our
OL,14,FNorth America correspondent explains
OL,15,Fwhy this matters
