OL,3,AIsraeli strike on hospital kills at
OL,4,Aleast five Palestinians, Gaza civil
OL,5,Adefence agency says
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least five Palestinians have been
OL,8,Fkilled after an Israeli airstrike hit a
OL,9,Fbuilding at Nasser Hospital in southern
OL,10,FGaza, an official from the Hamas-run
OL,11,FCivil Defence agency has told the BBC.
OL,13,FEyewitnesses said that a single
OL,14,Fmissile, fired from a warplane that
OL,15,Fbriefly flew over the area, struck a
OL,16,Fbuilding housing the hospital's
OL,17,Fsurgical wards and intensive care
OL,18,Funits. Twenty others were injured, the
OL,19,Fcivil defence spokesman said.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
